  "summary": "Turn-of-millennium pop fashion: low-rise jeans, baby tees, butterfly clips, metallics and tech-optimistic shine.",
  "description": "Y2K fashion fused dot-com optimism with pop-star glamour: low-rise bootcut jeans, halter baby tees, velour tracksuits, butterfly clips, tinted sunglasses and chrome accents, broadcast by Britney, Destiny's Child and Paris Hilton. The style's revival from ~2019 (TikTok, Depop) made it the definitive Gen-Z nostalgia look, riding alongside Frutiger Aero and McBling revivals.",
